[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u5341\u4e5d\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_b",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong with her...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an acute symptom of Oripathy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's only been a week...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's also an acute form of Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka, which type is yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What, are you concerned about me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, if Franka passes away, I hope that Rhodes Island will cremate her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's mean, Liskarm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who's always talking about passing the infection on to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aha... Ahaha...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The difference between the acute and chronic types is a rather complicated topic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, Misha's condition is very dangerous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we don't do anything, this condition will become life threatening very quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we can do is give her some emergency treatment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we must control Misha's symptoms as quickly as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to make this clear to Lungmen. After this ends, we have to bring Misha with us back to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is part of our responsibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she... going to explode soon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oww! That hurt! Why'd you hit me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your mouth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ughh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'm going to explode one day, I'll make sure to crawl up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry! Miss Franka, please forgive me for everything I've done!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfft...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's transfer her to a safe place first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, we seem to have a situation behind us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing? ! Get out! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all fellow Infected here, don't make us resort to violence! Get out of our way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already destroyed our home, and now you're trying to get the L.G.D. here?! Forget it! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "You little...! You ignorant fool, get out of the way! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Argh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now you've done it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Are we going to step in?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "(We seem to have finally lost them. But if we intervene now, we're going to be exposed.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Is this going to get in the way of our mission? If so, how serious are the consequences going to be?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Of course this is going to interfere, but...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It won't be that serious, right?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's do it, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island's unequivocal mission to save the Infected, as long as the situation permits.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhm, good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew following you was the right decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean by that, Miss Franka?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, don't worry! I was just complimenting you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She probably thinks that she can get along well with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you know me so well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably because you're so annoying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time to teach these thugs a lesson.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful of the enemies who can jump between buildings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In addition, make sure to protect Lungmen's Infected civilians!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's asking for a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "--But, I'll handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, let's go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, make sure to lead me and Texas well!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
